  - m_Id: 108754519281115136
    m_Localized: "Bibliograf\xEDa general consultada en el estudio de correcci\xF3n,
      validaci\xF3n y adiciones al guion del tour virtual 360\xB0 al Palacio de Carondelet:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754544929284096
    m_Localized: 'Con el apoyo de:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754609223770112
    m_Localized: "Validaci\xF3n de textos hist\xF3ricos:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754949654454272
    m_Localized: 'Desarrollo:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126823099914526720
    m_Localized: "Usa el teclado para navegar \nPara desactivar el modo accesible
      presiona \u201CTab\u201D "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126823290252042240
    m_Localized: "<b>360\xB0 Virtual Tour \u2013 Palacio de Carondelet</b>\r\nThis
      virtual tour is a digital platform of an informational, educational, and cultural
      nature, developed with the objective of promoting and enhancing the historical
      and cultural heritage of Palacio de Carondelet.\r\n<b>1. Scope of Virtual Reconstructions</b>\r\n\u2022\tThe
      virtual recreations and tours are digital representations developed based on
      historical information, visual records, and specialized technical criteria.
      Consequently, they may present variations in details, proportions, colors,
      textures, and lighting compared to the real physical space.\r\n\u2022\tThese
      recreations do not replace the in-person experience nor constitute an exact
      or definitive record of the building. As technological interpretations of a
      heritage space, they may differ partially or entirely from the physical visit,
      and such differences shall not give rise to institutional liability.\r\n<b>2.
      Historical and Interpretative Content</b>\r\n\u2022\tThe historical narratives
      included in the tour are based on historiographical criteria and the availability
      of documentary sources; therefore, they constitute well-founded interpretations.\r\n\u2022\tThe
      information contained in the plaques of the presidential portraits corresponds
      to the data of the original objects exhibited in the Sal\xF3n de los Presidentes.\r\n<b>3.
      Collaborations and Specific Content</b>\r\n\u2022\tThe temporary exhibition
      \u201CD\xEDas de la Patria\u201D is a collaborative initiative of the Ministerio
      de Relaciones Exteriores y Movilidad Humana.\r\n\u2022\tThe written translation
      into Kichwa has been carried out in standardized Kichwa. The audio recordings
      of the Baron de Carondelet in Kichwa are interpreted in the Otavalo Kichwa
      dialect. The interpretations of the Baron de Carondelet in English and French
      were performed by an Ecuadorian actor.\r\n<b>4. Technical Requirements and
      Functionality</b>\r\n\u2022\tThe 3D experience of this virtual tour requires
      a minimum level of technical performance. Therefore, optimal functionality
      cannot be guaranteed on devices that do not meet the following specifications:\r\n<b>Mobile
      Devices</b>\r\n\u2022\tMid-range or higher smartphone (within the last 3\u20134
      years)\r\n\u2022\t4 GB RAM or higher\r\n\u2022\t64 GB storage or higher\r\n\u2022\tAndroid
      13 or later / iPhone with iOS 15 or later\r\n\u2022\tUpdated browser (Chrome,
      Safari, or similar)\r\n\u2022\tStable 4G or Wi-Fi internet connection\r\n<b>Computers
      (PC or Mac)</b>\r\n\u2022\tModern processor (equivalent to Intel Core i5 or
      Ryzen 5 or higher)\r\n\u2022\t16 GB RAM\r\n\u2022\tSolid-state drive (SSD)
      of 512 GB or higher\r\n\u2022\tWindows 11, macOS Monterey (12) or later, or
      updated Linux\r\n\u2022\tUpdated browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, or Safari)\r\n\u2022\tStable
      internet connection (Wi-Fi or wired)\r\n<b>Tablets</b>\r\n\u2022\tMid-range
      or higher tablet\r\n\u2022\t4 GB RAM or higher\r\n\u2022\t64 GB storage or
      higher\r\n\u2022\tAndroid 12+, iPadOS 15+, or equivalent updated system\r\n\u2022\tUpdated
      modern browser\r\n\u2022\tStable Wi-Fi connection (LTE/5G optional)\r\n\u2022\tVisual
      quality (colors, resolution, and contrast) may vary depending on the device
      used.\r\nThe use of a mouse is recommended for navigating the platform, as
      it enables more precise and fluid interaction within three-dimensional environments.
      Where a laptop trackpad is used, its performance may vary depending on the
      device model, sensitivity, system configuration, and browser, which may affect
      the navigation experience and the accurate interaction with elements of the
      virtual tour.\r\n<b>5. User Responsibility and Limitations</b>\r\n\u2022\tAccess
      to and use of the virtual tour is undertaken under the sole responsibility
      of the user.\r\n\u2022\tThe institution shall not be held liable for service
      interruptions, technical failures, incompatibility with devices, browsers,
      or operating systems, nor for any direct or indirect damages arising from the
      use of the platform.\r\n<b>6. Intellectual Property</b>\r\n\u2022\tAll content
      within the virtual tour is protected under applicable intellectual property
      and copyright regulations.\r\n\u2022\tReproduction, distribution, or use for
      commercial purposes without the express authorization of the institution is
      prohibited.\r\n<b>7. Content Updates</b>\r\n\u2022\tThe content presented\u2014including
      texts, images, audio, video, 3D models, and interactive resources\u2014is provided
      for reference purposes and may be subject to updates or technical or interpretative
      adjustments without prior notice.\r\n\u2022\tThe institution does not guarantee
      the absolute accuracy, completeness, or permanent validity of the published
      information.\r\n\r\n"
